OL,5,G0700 Inside the Ambulance
OL,6,     FThe paramedic crews treat a drug
OL,7,     Fuser with a burst abscess, an
OL,8,     Felderly woman whose face has
OL,9,     Fswollen, and a distraught young
OL,10,     Fwoman who may be suffering a
OL,11,     Fmiscarriage.
OL,12,G0800 Inside the Ambulance
OL,13,     FParamedics attend an accident at a
OL,14,     Fbus station, and treat a feisty
OL,15,     Fpensioner who has angina, a young
OL,16,     Fmum with a suspected stroke, and a
OL,17,     Fchild hit by a cricket bat.
